      1						.TITLE UJFP11
      2						.IDENT /00.11/
      3					; CP79 DCJ11 FPP software emulation. Absolute HALT FRAM, CP67 module ABI3.
      4					; LDFPS/STFPS/STST support all eight word addressing modes.
      5					; Full documented FP11 instruction families; ordinary code in HALT FRAM.
